'''Meow Meow Day''' is an event added in [[Version 8.9 Update|version 8.9]]. It appears on the '''22nd''' of every month for that day only. During this event, a [[Treasure Festival]] will be available in all [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]] and a new map called [[CAT DAY]] will appear in [[Legend Stages]].

==Event Information==
A limited-time event to celebrate the brave Cat Army, and it only comes around once per year on August 8th!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from August 8th (12:00am) until August 16th (11:59pm)!'''}}

・Log in to earn {{Color|#4A86E8|'''2 Rare Tickets'''}} and {{Color|#4A86E8|'''2 Leaderships'''}}!<br>
・Earn a one-time reward of {{Color|#FF0000|'''22 Cat Food'''}} by clearing the {{Color|#0000FF|'''Meow Meow Day'''}} Special Stage during the event!<br>
・{{Color|#34A853|'''Treasure Fests'''}} on in Empire of Cats, Into the Future, and Cats of the Cosmos!<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Check the Event Calendar for event availability.

Don't miss the rewards only available on this special day!

