==Trivia==
*Meow Meow Day occurs on the 22nd of the month because 2 is pronounced ''ni'' in Japanese, which sounds similar to ''nyan'', which is also why February 22nd is [[wikipedia:National Cat Day|National Cat Day]] in Japan.

